# Lead Protocol — per-project .gitignore (template baseline)
#
# `.agents/local/` holds per-actor, per-agent state (handoff, tasks, activity log,
# personal lessons). It is the volatile layer of the three-layer state model and
# MUST NOT be committed — it is not shared between contributors, and committing
# it leaks personal context while also creating spurious merge conflicts.
#
# Everything else under `.agents/` (framework files, JOURNAL, LESSONS,
# decisions.jsonl, AGENTS_MAP, checkpoints, sessions) is shared project state
# and remains tracked.
.agents/local/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
